== Trivia ==
*The '''Hellfire Rod''' used to be the Rod that could give the most {{Stat|fs}} prior to the [[Attributes|Attribute]] revamp. Assuming that it had Fishing Speed X as one of its attributes and all 10 stars, it would grant the player {{Stat|120 Fishing Speed}}.
*Though impractical, a [[Recombobulator 3000|Recombobulated]] '''Hellfire Rod''' with {{Ref|Chomp}}, {{Item|Shredded Line}}, and 10 {{Star|1}} will have decent [[Combat]] stats: {{Stat|dmg|520}}, {{Stat|str|320}}, {{Stat|fero|50}}, and {{stat|cd|50}}.

